task:
Eight more poses of the same narrator:
1. scared: hugging himself, shoulders up, worried eyes to the side;
2. whispering to the viewer behind one raised hand, leaning in;
3. counting on his fingers, one hand showing three fingers;
4. holding up a small blank cream card in front of his chest with both hands;
5. arms crossed, one eyebrow raised, skeptical, a small smirk;
6. sitting on a small wooden folding stool, hands on his knees, looking up in awe;
7. looking through a brass magnifying glass held up to one eye, the eye huge behind the lens;
8. waving hello with one hand, big warm smile.
